WEBVTT

00:00:03.893 --> 00:00:09.009
On the Spirit I must have
given at least, I don’t know,

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:12.864
about at least 100 lectures so far
only on the subject of Spirit.

00:00:12.944 --> 00:00:14.818
So it’s an endless job.

00:00:14.899 --> 00:00:19.247
And every time I say something people say,
“Mother you have said something very new.”

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.357
So the knowledge is endless
but you become the knowledge.

00:00:22.437 --> 00:00:26.006
You yourself become the knowledge
and you start understanding it.

00:00:26.087 --> 00:00:29.504
Only thing is, you must have, as a duty,

00:00:29.624 --> 00:00:32.116
respect for yourself,

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:37.025
and the importance of responsibility
that you have to be the Spirit.

00:00:37.145 --> 00:00:41.393
That’s why you have come
on this earth as human beings

00:00:41.495 --> 00:00:45.555
at this time. This time is very precious

00:00:45.636 --> 00:00:48.538
and it’s not a fashion to be a seeker.

00:00:48.618 --> 00:00:53.509
But, it’s something that
has to happen to all of you.

00:00:53.589 --> 00:00:56.096
Yesterday you people
asked me many questions

00:00:56.216 --> 00:00:59.710
and I think I answered most of them.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.589
Some of them were very good questions

00:01:01.669 --> 00:01:08.001
but some were of them
a little very simple I think,

00:01:08.121 --> 00:01:11.606
but nobody was aggressive.

00:01:11.726 --> 00:01:15.107
But on the whole, I think that, maybe,

00:01:15.189 --> 00:01:20.212
San Diego is a place from where
we may be able to save America.

00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:23.610
I didn’t have any program anywhere
in Los Angeles or anything,

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:25.430
but I came to San Diego.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:28.822
But you have to know that if this is the place

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:34.233
we have to get people who are of that quality,

00:01:34.315 --> 00:01:36.865
I don’t know when are we going to get them.

00:01:36.947 --> 00:01:40.050
But I hope we get those people of that quality.

00:01:40.170 --> 00:01:45.420
Even a small nail can hold a sari.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.453
In the same way, a little place
looking like San Diego

00:01:48.573 --> 00:01:51.597
can save America.

00:01:53.769 --> 00:01:56.463
May God bless you all.

00:02:01.505 --> 00:02:06.215
So we'll have the experience now.

00:02:06.335 --> 00:02:10.917
It will take about five minutes for you
because if all the chakras are discussed,

00:02:10.999 --> 00:02:13.274
already the attention is on that.

00:02:13.376 --> 00:02:17.651
It's very simple to put your hands towards me.

00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:21.319


00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:32.827
It's better. You've done a good job.

00:02:33.891 --> 00:02:37.289
Just put your hands towards me.

00:02:37.409 --> 00:02:40.611
Just like this.

00:02:55.566 --> 00:02:58.103
Left.

00:03:08.249 --> 00:03:11.475
Now, left hand towards me and
right hand towards the Mother Earth.

00:03:11.556 --> 00:03:15.360
It will give you a balance. You need not
close your eyes just now, let's see.

00:03:15.441 --> 00:03:19.716
Put your right hand towards the Mother Earth.

00:03:19.797 --> 00:03:23.938
As I told you yesterday,
left side is our conditioning.

00:03:24.019 --> 00:03:27.537
Conditioning, subconscious
and collective subconscious.

00:03:27.657 --> 00:03:29.580
Very much at work here.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.098
But also is an emotional side.

00:03:44.571 --> 00:03:50.214
Now put your right hand towards me,
and left hand towards the sky.

00:03:50.295 --> 00:03:51.682
Right hand towards me.

00:03:51.762 --> 00:03:54.774
Right hand towards me like this.

00:04:10.456 --> 00:04:13.611
Are you feeling the cool breeze in the hand?

00:04:15.046 --> 00:04:18.173
You are already thoughtless. There's no thought.

00:04:18.275 --> 00:04:21.771
