Let's see.

00:05:09.195 --> 00:05:10.865
All right?

00:05:42.379 --> 00:05:45.341
Are you feeling any cool breeze in the hand?

00:05:46.864 --> 00:05:51.242
All right, now put your
left hand on top of your head.

00:05:51.809 --> 00:05:56.719
Just here. Fontanel bone area.

00:05:57.558 --> 00:05:59.894
Are you feeling?

00:06:00.014 --> 00:06:04.021
It's a very subtle thing.

00:06:04.595 --> 00:06:06.341
Are you?

00:06:08.057 --> 00:06:09.876
Pay attention.

00:06:12.565 --> 00:06:15.323
Working out. Good?

00:06:16.365 --> 00:06:17.844
All right. Now, change over.

00:06:17.924 --> 00:06:19.725
See the left hand. With the right hand.

00:06:19.805 --> 00:06:23.613
Just pay attention there, see.

00:06:30.577 --> 00:06:32.889
Believe that you are the Spirit.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:36.276
So just you have to say
