00:06:36.357 --> 00:06:41.838
In your heart. Say it seven times.
It will work out.

00:06:51.262 --> 00:06:53.262
Releasing.

00:06:54.528 --> 00:06:56.528
Is it all right?

00:06:57.535 --> 00:06:59.845
Are you feeling the heat coming out?

00:06:59.965 --> 00:07:01.388
Little heat.

00:07:01.508 --> 00:07:05.521
All right, now turn. Change. See now.

00:07:09.658 --> 00:07:11.658
Right Swadhishthan.

00:07:15.287 --> 00:07:17.287
All right?

00:07:18.931 --> 00:07:20.931
Good? Amazing.

00:07:24.408 --> 00:07:29.185
Now just see if it is working. Cool breeze.

00:07:33.747 --> 00:07:37.271
Feel it. Just put your hands like this.

00:07:48.627 --> 00:07:50.627
It's good.

00:07:52.153 --> 00:07:56.402
You're all thoughtless. If you see,
there's no thought in your mind.

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:02.228
In complete silence.

00:08:03.033 --> 00:08:05.033
Enjoy this.

00:08:05.865 --> 00:08:09.482
This moment is going to transform your life,

00:08:09.602 --> 00:08:11.657
take it from me.

00:08:12.494 --> 00:08:15.207
You may not realise today,

00:08:15.309 --> 00:08:18.788
but you’ll realise it very soon.

00:08:20.309 --> 00:08:23.297
Ah. Strong.

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:29.724
Have faith in yourself, that’s the main thing.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.733
It’s beautiful.

00:08:37.187 --> 00:08:42.450
Now all those who are feeling the
cool breeze in the hand or in the head,

00:08:42.531 --> 00:08:47.329
