Both the hands like this.

00:08:50.656 --> 00:08:52.771
Could you believe it?

00:08:52.852 --> 00:08:54.622
Most of you.

00:08:54.703 --> 00:08:56.735
May God bless you.

00:08:56.816 --> 00:09:02.317
Except for one or two. Maybe you have come for
the first time. Have you come for the first time?

00:09:02.398 --> 00:09:06.051
All right, maybe. We’ll see you, it’s not difficult.

00:09:06.171 --> 00:09:10.745
Today it’s very powerful day. It's worked out.

00:09:10.865 --> 00:09:13.499
Now know that you have found it,

00:09:13.619 --> 00:09:15.531
but establish yourself.

00:09:15.651 --> 00:09:20.328
This is very important is to establish.
Luckily you have a very good centre here.

00:09:20.448 --> 00:09:23.679
And we have to work it out
through San Diego.

00:09:25.696 --> 00:09:29.911
From this side and from New Jersey
from the other side.

00:09:29.992 --> 00:09:32.366
You have to work it out.

00:09:32.447 --> 00:09:35.521
All of you must remember

00:09:35.641 --> 00:09:38.817
that you have got your realisation.

00:09:38.898 --> 00:09:42.030
I don’t want to take any promises from you,

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:45.449
