00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.635
Respect it. Respect your realisation.

00:09:48.755 --> 00:09:50.374
Respect yourself.

00:09:50.476 --> 00:09:53.807
Now you will find you have a purpose in life,

00:09:53.888 --> 00:09:58.488
and just understand how
this Divine power works.

00:09:58.569 --> 00:10:02.299
And how we can manage it and control it.

00:10:02.419 --> 00:10:07.451
How we can manoeuvre it, and how

00:10:07.532 --> 00:10:11.899
